(5847262, 851259, 65234, '<td valign="top">Mergansers and a heron and ... a pair of ducks, maybe loons?  Can''t quite make them out.  Not a tack sharp detailed scene but very familiar to me.  There is always a branch or something where I don''t want it and I get all perfectionist and clone it out.  This is so much more real.  I find myself liking the subtle framing and main diagonal line of the branch.</td>', 'Mergansers and a heron and ... a pair of ducks, maybe loons?  Can''t quite make them out.  Not a tack sharp detailed scene but very familiar to me.  There is always a branch or something where I don''t want it and I get all perfectionist and clone it out.  This is so much more real.  I find myself liking the subtle framing and main diagonal line of the branch.', '2010-02-01 11:02:56.000000', NULL, 1),
