(5847659, 850800, 44611, '<td valign="top">I''m a sucker for the pinks in flamingos and you''ve captured the colour and feather detail here beautifully.  Would prefer this without the heavy black frame however .. a much more delicate frame would seem appropriate.</td>', 'I''m a sucker for the pinks in flamingos and you''ve captured the colour and feather detail here beautifully.  Would prefer this without the heavy black frame however .. a much more delicate frame would seem appropriate.', '2010-02-01 14:45:49.000000', NULL, 1),
