(5847669, 851153, 44611, '<td valign="top">Very misty and moody with lovely colours.  I sort of wish the reflection line for the trees was a tad more distinct ... and possibly a slight crop at the bottom might have improved this.   I like it though.</td>', 'Very misty and moody with lovely colours.  I sort of wish the reflection line for the trees was a tad more distinct ... and possibly a slight crop at the bottom might have improved this.   I like it though.', '2010-02-01 14:49:08.000000', NULL, 1),
