(5847839, 849953, 17446, '<td valign="top">Favorited.</td>', 'Favorited.', '2010-02-01 15:51:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5847871, 851088, 44611, '<td valign="top">Good macro detail, could use just a bit more colour pop to make it a bit more exciting.</td>', 'Good macro detail, could use just a bit more colour pop to make it a bit more exciting.', '2010-02-01 16:00:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5847872, 850802, 44611, '<td valign="top">Terrific eagle shot.  Lovely detail</td>', 'Terrific eagle shot.  Lovely detail', '2010-02-01 16:00:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5847876, 851295, 44611, '<td valign="top">Stunning, beautiful, perfection!  Absolutely amazing picture, I love the detail, the colour, the way the fox is looking right at you.  Definitely one of my top picks.  Congratulations on taking such a fabulous picture.</td>', 'Stunning, beautiful, perfection!  Absolutely amazing picture, I love the detail, the colour, the way the fox is looking right at you.  Definitely one of my top picks.  Congratulations on taking such a fabulous picture.', '2010-02-01 16:04:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5847878, 851259, 44611, '<td valign="top">Very different, very surrealistic, but I like this.  Not sure if it will have general appeal but it deserves a decent score I think.</td>', 'Very different, very surrealistic, but I like this.  Not sure if it will have general appeal but it deserves a decent score I think.', '2010-02-01 16:07:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5847886, 845917, 44611, '<td valign="top">Wow, it looks like it''s 3D and coming right out of the frame at you!  Brilliant capture.</td>', 'Wow, it looks like it''s 3D and coming right out of the frame at you!  Brilliant capture.', '2010-02-01 16:11:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5847890, 846606, 65234, '<td valign="top">Like the composition; a bit halo-y in quite a few places around the edge of the birds (could be a sharpeneing artifact; I don''t think it''s just motion blur).</td>', 'Like the composition; a bit halo-y in quite a few places around the edge of the birds (could be a sharpeneing artifact; I don''t think it''s just motion blur).', '2010-02-01 16:13:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5847896, 850066, 65234, '<td valign="top">That beak looks like it''s been through a lot!  Nice capture of the color and detail of the feathers.  I bet there are little bits of apple all over the floor under the parrot when he was done ... and maybe some on nearby walls if he''s anything like most birds I''ve met ;-)</td>', 'That beak looks like it''s been through a lot!  Nice capture of the color and detail of the feathers.  I bet there are little bits of apple all over the floor under the parrot when he was done ... and maybe some on nearby walls if he''s anything like most birds I''ve met ;-)', '2010-02-01 16:17:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5847899, 851155, 44611, '<td valign="top">Ah, sorry you''ve lost your dog.  He looks like he was quite a character.  Lovely b &amp; w shot.</td>', 'Ah, sorry you''ve lost your dog.  He looks like he was quite a character.  Lovely b & w shot.', '2010-02-01 16:18:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5847901, 851298, 44611, '<td valign="top">Clyde looks cute!  That''s a really bemused expression on his face .. he looks a bit like a gremlin!</td>', 'Clyde looks cute!  That''s a really bemused expression on his face .. he looks a bit like a gremlin!', '2010-02-01 16:20:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5847902, 851058, 65234, '<td valign="top">Love the light on the cat and the stare through a window we can''t see a darned thing through.  They do have much better eyesight than humans.  <br/> <br/>The curtain is jarring in pattern and color ... kind of detracts from the softness of the rest of the scene.  Or emphasizes it, I suppose.  No, I think I''d definitely crop it out and keep the low key stuff.  Personal preference ;-)</td>', 'Love the light on the cat and the stare through a window we can''t see a darned thing through.  They do have much better eyesight than humans.   The curtain is jarring in pattern and color ... kind of detracts from the softness of the rest of the scene.  Or emphasizes it, I suppose.  No, I think I''d definitely crop it out and keep the low key stuff.  Personal preference ;-)', '2010-02-01 16:21:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5847905, 849764, 26001, '<td valign="top">"The Presidential Punishment" :)<br/>(reference: Obama killed a mosquito/fly during an interview)</td>', '"The Presidential Punishment" :)(reference: Obama killed a mosquito/fly during an interview)', '2010-02-01 16:22:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5847907, 845985, 65234, '<td valign="top">Adorably fluffy bottom on that Goldfinch :-)  Like the tightly gripped feet, too.  Makes it quite clear it''s windy.<br/> <br/>Might prefer this somewhat less centered, just for a more interesting composition.</td>', 'Adorably fluffy bottom on that Goldfinch :-)  Like the tightly gripped feet, too.  Makes it quite clear it''s windy. Might prefer this somewhat less centered, just for a more interesting composition.', '2010-02-01 16:24:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5847908, 848574, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice pattern in that frost.</td>', 'Nice pattern in that frost.', '2010-02-01 16:24:31.000000', NULL, 1),
