(5847923, 850754, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed!  The gull''s alignment with the clouds is wonderful.  The magenta highlight in the water seems a tad over the top in color, but generally I like the colors and the detail on the beach and in the water.</td>', 'Nicely composed!  The gull''s alignment with the clouds is wonderful.  The magenta highlight in the water seems a tad over the top in color, but generally I like the colors and the detail on the beach and in the water.', '2010-02-01 16:29:57.000000', NULL, 1),
