(5849605, 850613, 65234, '<td valign="top">Uh-oh; not a good thing when these guys get in a fight.  Astounding moment to capture; I''m awed.  <br/> <br/>Looks like serious noise reduction on the right (or DOF didn''t quite catch all of the other eagle or something) but the drama is evident regardless of technicals.  Only thing I might try and "fix" would be to burn the pupil and outline of the eagle on the right to see if I could bring out more detail there and re-color/burn where the sky looks to be bleeding into the wing.  I am still much more impressed by this capture than a technically perfect portrait.</td>', 'Uh-oh; not a good thing when these guys get in a fight.  Astounding moment to capture; I''m awed.   Looks like serious noise reduction on the right (or DOF didn''t quite catch all of the other eagle or something) but the drama is evident regardless of technicals.  Only thing I might try and "fix" would be to burn the pupil and outline of the eagle on the right to see if I could bring out more detail there and re-color/burn where the sky looks to be bleeding into the wing.  I am still much more impressed by this capture than a technically perfect portrait.', '2010-02-02 20:13:31.000000', NULL, 1),
