(5850914, 851298, 88247, '<td valign="top">He is absolutley gorgeous!!<br/>What a lovely little face he''s got.<br/>How old?<br/>Maybe we could get him together with my Honey!!;-)<br/> <br/> <br/>Not voting.</td>', 'He is absolutley gorgeous!!What a lovely little face he''s got.How old?Maybe we could get him together with my Honey!!;-)  Not voting.', '2010-02-03 11:24:45.000000', NULL, 1),
