(5851026, 851018, 98339, '<td valign="top">Since you are practicing...here are the things that bother me...the tilt of her head...hyper extends her neck, most women do not need to have their necks emphasized. and the different colored ear rings they distract me...a little more eyeliner, lip gloss and face power to soften the shine on her face.  I like her eyes they are engaging me, but that bang in the middle of the eye...makes me (and I''m a hairdresser) want to push it out of the way...I want to see her eyes...</td>', 'Since you are practicing...here are the things that bother me...the tilt of her head...hyper extends her neck, most women do not need to have their necks emphasized. and the different colored ear rings they distract me...a little more eyeliner, lip gloss and face power to soften the shine on her face.  I like her eyes they are engaging me, but that bang in the middle of the eye...makes me (and I''m a hairdresser) want to push it out of the way...I want to see her eyes...', '2010-02-03 12:19:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5851031, 845087, 98339, '<td valign="top">I like the lights in the tower, but I don''t like the shake on the buildings surrounding it...and I just noticed...you put your watermark on this...you''ll get Dq''d for that...soooo sorry</td>', 'I like the lights in the tower, but I don''t like the shake on the buildings surrounding it...and I just noticed...you put your watermark on this...you''ll get Dq''d for that...soooo sorry', '2010-02-03 12:21:39.000000', NULL, 1),
