(5852156, 847904, 30982, '<td valign="top">Bold and vibrant and simply lovely.  The water droplets are a wonderful bonus!</td>', 'Bold and vibrant and simply lovely.  The water droplets are a wonderful bonus!', '2010-02-04 01:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5852157, 851011, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very lovely portrait!</td>', 'Very lovely portrait!', '2010-02-04 01:32:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5852158, 850946, 30982, '<td valign="top">Some may see this as overprocessed but I think its just right - love the vibrancy of the colors!</td>', 'Some may see this as overprocessed but I think its just right - love the vibrancy of the colors!', '2010-02-04 01:32:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5852190, 850599, 110108, '<td valign="top">I like the mix of colored and b/w effects</td>', 'I like the mix of colored and b/w effects', '2010-02-04 02:25:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5852195, 850888, 110333, '<td valign="top">Terrific, just terrific!</td>', 'Terrific, just terrific!', '2010-02-04 02:55:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5852209, 847195, 99710, '<td valign="top">The bird on that top of the stone is just amazing. 10</td>', 'The bird on that top of the stone is just amazing. 10', '2010-02-04 03:37:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5852212, 848301, 99710, '<td valign="top">Great catch, the person and the dog gives the photo it''s unique touch. 10</td>', 'Great catch, the person and the dog gives the photo it''s unique touch. 10', '2010-02-04 03:38:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5852224, 850819, 24486, '<td valign="top">Kids &amp; water. Two things that just go together so well.</td>', 'Kids & water. Two things that just go together so well.', '2010-02-04 04:20:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5852227, 851274, 24486, '<td valign="top">I have taken this shot a few times.I have never actually thought to do it as a black &amp; white until now. This works very well &amp; I like the fact there is only a single yacht.</td>', 'I have taken this shot a few times.I have never actually thought to do it as a black & white until now. This works very well & I like the fact there is only a single yacht.', '2010-02-04 04:24:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5852228, 850387, 24486, '<td valign="top">Very nicely captured. Great detail in the feathers</td>', 'Very nicely captured. Great detail in the feathers', '2010-02-04 04:32:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5852357, 849782, 98339, '<td valign="top">IMO this has to much grain for me...In a water picture I look for super crisp smooth lines and definition</td>', 'IMO this has to much grain for me...In a water picture I look for super crisp smooth lines and definition', '2010-02-04 09:08:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5852358, 850639, 98339, '<td valign="top">do I note a bit of hostility in this smile....hmmm such a cute one...great candid shot..</td>', 'do I note a bit of hostility in this smile....hmmm such a cute one...great candid shot..', '2010-02-04 09:08:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5852359, 850900, 98339, '<td valign="top">Nice HDR, possibly a little over sharpened, but really lovely colors</td>', 'Nice HDR, possibly a little over sharpened, but really lovely colors', '2010-02-04 09:09:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5852360, 847550, 98339, '<td valign="top">look at th water drops falling...really great focus and colors</td>', 'look at th water drops falling...really great focus and colors', '2010-02-04 09:09:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5852362, 847508, 98339, '<td valign="top">Not what I''d want to wake up to that...hmmm Focus seems to be soft and colors are a bit dull</td>', 'Not what I''d want to wake up to that...hmmm Focus seems to be soft and colors are a bit dull', '2010-02-04 09:13:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5852363, 851163, 98339, '<td valign="top">Nothing like an ice storm to trim trees.  To me there isn''t enough definition between the trees in the background and the foreground they blend to much.  But as a winter scene this is quite pretty</td>', 'Nothing like an ice storm to trim trees.  To me there isn''t enough definition between the trees in the background and the foreground they blend to much.  But as a winter scene this is quite pretty', '2010-02-04 09:15:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5852364, 849764, 98339, '<td valign="top">yuck.....yuck....way to much detail (kidding)</td>', 'yuck.....yuck....way to much detail (kidding)', '2010-02-04 09:15:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5852370, 851056, 98339, '<td valign="top">To me the lighting is to harsh on the face, and it seems that the whole face should be in total sharp focus, you chin is not in focus at all</td>', 'To me the lighting is to harsh on the face, and it seems that the whole face should be in total sharp focus, you chin is not in focus at all', '2010-02-04 09:17:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5852371, 846327, 98339, '<td valign="top">for me your focus is not super clear...you have great colors although</td>', 'for me your focus is not super clear...you have great colors although', '2010-02-04 09:17:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5852372, 849907, 98339, '<td valign="top">boy, those don''t look like natural poses do they...I think I''ve seen the guy in competitions before.  great color not an easy shot to get indoors</td>', 'boy, those don''t look like natural poses do they...I think I''ve seen the guy in competitions before.  great color not an easy shot to get indoors', '2010-02-04 09:17:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5852373, 850950, 98339, '<td valign="top">for me this is to grainy a noise filter could do wonders to this and the subject on the bike needs to be in sharper focus...silhouetted is fine but the focus needs to be extremely sharp</td>', 'for me this is to grainy a noise filter could do wonders to this and the subject on the bike needs to be in sharper focus...silhouetted is fine but the focus needs to be extremely sharp', '2010-02-04 09:19:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5852374, 851192, 98339, '<td valign="top">I like your lighting...might be a touch harsh but I like the clarity of the shot</td>', 'I like your lighting...might be a touch harsh but I like the clarity of the shot', '2010-02-04 09:19:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5852375, 849937, 98339, '<td valign="top">Personally I''m not a fan of the shadows on her face and her body position looks awkward</td>', 'Personally I''m not a fan of the shadows on her face and her body position looks awkward', '2010-02-04 09:19:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5852376, 851185, 98339, '<td valign="top">Wonderful detail, these seem to be such gentle creatures (until you rile them up)</td>', 'Wonderful detail, these seem to be such gentle creatures (until you rile them up)', '2010-02-04 09:20:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5852378, 850810, 98339, '<td valign="top">I can barely see the vase it is not in super clear focus nor is your flower</td>', 'I can barely see the vase it is not in super clear focus nor is your flower', '2010-02-04 09:21:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5852380, 850880, 98339, '<td valign="top">you have a great look on the model, but your scarf that you used looks extremely dull/flat in color and tone...it looks like you did a partial de-saturation of the picture thus making is quite flat.</td>', 'you have a great look on the model, but your scarf that you used looks extremely dull/flat in color and tone...it looks like you did a partial de-saturation of the picture thus making is quite flat.', '2010-02-04 09:23:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5852384, 850972, 98339, '<td valign="top">that is one intense picture/look.  Her eyes are beautiful but the thrust of the chin takes away from the picture for me.  You have super clear focus and great color...it''s the head position that I don''t like.</td>', 'that is one intense picture/look.  Her eyes are beautiful but the thrust of the chin takes away from the picture for me.  You have super clear focus and great color...it''s the head position that I don''t like.', '2010-02-04 09:25:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5852385, 846606, 98339, '<td valign="top">for me this appears to be taken at the height of the day (full brilliant sun) and I think that a gradient would improve this alot...you background seems to have lost alot of details</td>', 'for me this appears to be taken at the height of the day (full brilliant sun) and I think that a gradient would improve this alot...you background seems to have lost alot of details', '2010-02-04 09:25:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5852386, 848667, 98339, '<td valign="top">for me this seems to have a slight tilt to it (higher on the left).  But a good clear shot</td>', 'for me this seems to have a slight tilt to it (higher on the left).  But a good clear shot', '2010-02-04 09:25:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5852387, 850605, 98339, '<td valign="top">such a pretty kitty...makes me miss mine... could use a bit stronger focus (seems just a tad soft) or USM</td>', 'such a pretty kitty...makes me miss mine... could use a bit stronger focus (seems just a tad soft) or USM', '2010-02-04 09:25:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5852388, 850612, 98339, '<td valign="top">everything in this picture gives it an "old time feel" like it came from my childhood (sigh).  Personally I really like the ratty feel of this</td>', 'everything in this picture gives it an "old time feel" like it came from my childhood (sigh).  Personally I really like the ratty feel of this', '2010-02-04 09:26:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5852389, 849930, 98339, '<td valign="top">had to look up the meaning of your title...I would like to see sharper focus on this</td>', 'had to look up the meaning of your title...I would like to see sharper focus on this', '2010-02-04 09:26:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5852390, 846775, 98339, '<td valign="top">but your lens is dirty...should have cleaned that up for this type of challenge.</td>', 'but your lens is dirty...should have cleaned that up for this type of challenge.', '2010-02-04 09:27:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5852391, 849962, 98339, '<td valign="top">not sure I get the title...but I love the clearness of the Candy Cane.  Super sharp and great colors</td>', 'not sure I get the title...but I love the clearness of the Candy Cane.  Super sharp and great colors', '2010-02-04 09:28:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5852393, 850010, 98339, '<td valign="top">nice still life, good vibrant colors</td>', 'nice still life, good vibrant colors', '2010-02-04 09:28:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5852394, 847899, 98339, '<td valign="top">it seems to me that this is just a "little dull/flat" in the colors/tones.  I''m not saying to push it over the top...just that is could look more alive in the color</td>', 'it seems to me that this is just a "little dull/flat" in the colors/tones.  I''m not saying to push it over the top...just that is could look more alive in the color', '2010-02-04 09:29:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5852396, 849749, 98339, '<td valign="top">ok, this is technical..but I would have cloned out the little twigs in the top of this picture.  For me you have a wonderful capture but it is dull in tone...when you convert to B&amp;W if you push your Hue &amp; Saturation more it will help to richen up your tones alot.  I just happen to love the very richly toned pictures.</td>', 'ok, this is technical..but I would have cloned out the little twigs in the top of this picture.  For me you have a wonderful capture but it is dull in tone...when you convert to B&W if you push your Hue & Saturation more it will help to richen up your tones alot.  I just happen to love the very richly toned pictures.', '2010-02-04 09:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5852400, 845661, 98339, '<td valign="top">here is where a gradient would help you out a whole lot in IMO.  When you apply the gradient on this it will help to "tone down" that brilliant bright sun and richen up the colors that are in your picture.  I love the old building</td>', 'here is where a gradient would help you out a whole lot in IMO.  When you apply the gradient on this it will help to "tone down" that brilliant bright sun and richen up the colors that are in your picture.  I love the old building', '2010-02-04 09:33:12.000000', NULL, 1),
