(5853565, 850994, 98339, '<td valign="top">you have such potential with this picture...did you know that when you convert to B&amp;W that if you push your hue and saturation a good bit that when you convert the picture you can achieve richer deeper tones...this looks like such a great picture but it is flat and dull in tone to me</td>', 'you have such potential with this picture...did you know that when you convert to B&W that if you push your hue and saturation a good bit that when you convert the picture you can achieve richer deeper tones...this looks like such a great picture but it is flat and dull in tone to me', '2010-02-04 23:55:22.000000', NULL, 1),
