(5853875, 850569, 113278, '<td valign="top">The big problems for me in this shot are the following: It is too busy with too many colors/patterns from the bags to the blouse, It is very noisy maybe it was too dark or your iso was set on the high end and there is a lot going on in the background. I would suggest to simplify eberything, bounce a flash and make sure the iso is set lower and open up the aperature so you can blur the background.</td>', 'The big problems for me in this shot are the following: It is too busy with too many colors/patterns from the bags to the blouse, It is very noisy maybe it was too dark or your iso was set on the high end and there is a lot going on in the background. I would suggest to simplify eberything, bounce a flash and make sure the iso is set lower and open up the aperature so you can blur the background.', '2010-02-05 07:15:37.000000', NULL, 1),
