(5854906, 849937, 83313, '<td valign="top">Watch your JPEG compression settings. I see some artifacts around her locket and a few other areas. At only a 58k file size, you could have used way less compression and gotten far more clarity in this image without those artifacts.<br/> <br/> <br/>Like the idea though, and I am resisting the temptation to put down a joke about the characteristics of the perfect woman.</td>', 'Watch your JPEG compression settings. I see some artifacts around her locket and a few other areas. At only a 58k file size, you could have used way less compression and gotten far more clarity in this image without those artifacts.  Like the idea though, and I am resisting the temptation to put down a joke about the characteristics of the perfect woman.', '2010-02-06 02:12:02.000000', NULL, 1),
