(5854921, 850469, 103032, '<td valign="top">Looks like a Lensbaby shot which I''m partial to.  Good sweet spot on the eyes and face.  From the title, I understand the image is of a glance, but I wonder if you had the model looking at you (eye contact with the viewer) would have made this a stronger photo by making a stronger connection with the viewer.  Just a thought.</td>', 'Looks like a Lensbaby shot which I''m partial to.  Good sweet spot on the eyes and face.  From the title, I understand the image is of a glance, but I wonder if you had the model looking at you (eye contact with the viewer) would have made this a stronger photo by making a stronger connection with the viewer.  Just a thought.', '2010-02-06 03:00:47.000000', NULL, 1),
