(5856535, 851014, 100393, '<td valign="top">I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images. <br/> <br/>Positives: A very effective juxtaposition - it''s as if the whole parking lot is afloat in a cloud. The splash of red on the jacket works really well too. Of course the blurry foreground gulls make the image here and gives the work a sense of life and dynamism that might otherwise be lacking.<br/> <br/>Critical stuff: I can''t think of any changes in your edit that might make this more effective for me.<br/> <br/>Overall: A fine piece of work.</td>', 'I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images.  Positives: A very effective juxtaposition - it''s as if the whole parking lot is afloat in a cloud. The splash of red on the jacket works really well too. Of course the blurry foreground gulls make the image here and gives the work a sense of life and dynamism that might otherwise be lacking. Critical stuff: I can''t think of any changes in your edit that might make this more effective for me. Overall: A fine piece of work.', '2010-02-07 09:22:29.000000', NULL, 1),
