(5857277, 851078, 34659, '<td valign="top">Perfect focus/DOF.  Perfect color tones.  My only (very slight) gripe is the composition - I would have cropped more off-center (and I know I''m splitting hairs at this point because it''s an amazing shot!).  BUT, I realize that not everyone''s taste is the same.  You''ve got a 9 from me regardless.</td>', 'Perfect focus/DOF.  Perfect color tones.  My only (very slight) gripe is the composition - I would have cropped more off-center (and I know I''m splitting hairs at this point because it''s an amazing shot!).  BUT, I realize that not everyone''s taste is the same.  You''ve got a 9 from me regardless.', '2010-02-07 19:19:29.000000', NULL, 1),
