(5859679, 850349, 86447, '<td valign="top">Fabulous place and extremely well photographed!  I''m so glad I''m able to appreciate it from the warmth of my home.  Thanks for that.   <br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by NodWag:</b></div><hr/><i> ...I am speechless.  Thank you!  I am incredibly grateful for the comments submitted as they are from some extremely talented photographers.  The fact that these people appreciated the image speaks volumes.  I''m going to enjoy this feat as I can''t even imagine when I''ll be back on the front page.  Again, thank you all for the kind and supportive comments.</i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I normally will not leave a comment on an image that the photographer does not check the "This comment was helpful" box since I''m not sure if he/she ever even looks at them... so why waste my time when there are other entries whose photographers live for comments to learn from?<br/> <br/>Anyway, your comment above leads me to believe that you do read them... just are negligent about letting folks know.<br/> <br/>Congrats on your ribbon!!   It''s a stunning shot.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Fabulous place and extremely well photographed!  I''m so glad I''m able to appreciate it from the warmth of my home.  Thanks for that.    Originally posted by NodWag: ...I am speechless.  Thank you!  I am incredibly grateful for the comments submitted as they are from some extremely talented photographers.  The fact that these people appreciated the image speaks volumes.  I''m going to enjoy this feat as I can''t even imagine when I''ll be back on the front page.  Again, thank you all for the kind and supportive comments.  I normally will not leave a comment on an image that the photographer does not check the "This comment was helpful" box since I''m not sure if he/she ever even looks at them... so why waste my time when there are other entries whose photographers live for comments to learn from? Anyway, your comment above leads me to believe that you do read them... just are negligent about letting folks know. Congrats on your ribbon!!   It''s a stunning shot. ', '2010-02-08 19:09:24.000000', NULL, 0),
