(5859758, 850540, 59029, '<td valign="top">Greetings from the Critique Club!<br/> <br/>Joao, what a stunning shot of the big bad wolf moon! Not surprised it was validated, with the moon that big, crisp and detailed.<br/> <br/>The setup and lens swap during shooting, all without blurring the image - just great timing and an amazing technique, that clearly works great when done properly.  The long exposure also adds a magnificent silky/icy texture to the water, and the soft blur around the bridge''s lights adds to the scene instead of detracting.  <br/> <br/>Just highlights how small and insignificant we really are.  Thank you for giving me the chance to critique a shot that should have placed much higher than it did.  Great work!<br/> <br/>Feel free to PM me with any questions,<br/> <br/>Susan</td>', 'Greetings from the Critique Club! Joao, what a stunning shot of the big bad wolf moon! Not surprised it was validated, with the moon that big, crisp and detailed. The setup and lens swap during shooting, all without blurring the image - just great timing and an amazing technique, that clearly works great when done properly.  The long exposure also adds a magnificent silky/icy texture to the water, and the soft blur around the bridge''s lights adds to the scene instead of detracting.   Just highlights how small and insignificant we really are.  Thank you for giving me the chance to critique a shot that should have placed much higher than it did.  Great work! Feel free to PM me with any questions, Susan', '2010-02-08 20:13:59.000000', NULL, 0),
