(5860560, 850547, 14476, '<td valign="top"><b>GREETINGS FROM THE CRITIQUE CLUB</b> <br/> <br/>Wow!  this is spectacular.  You took a very difficult subject and photographed it well.  It is immensely difficult to photograph glass without showing everything that collects on a clear reflective surface and you nailed it.  <br/> <br/>I''m afraid HotPasta hit it with his comment that this subject has been done before on DPC.  Some of our "world-weary" voters find happiness in newer pastures.  It doesn''t - or shouldn''t - dilute the fun of those who want to master the procedure.<br/> <br/>You have an image that displays well and in this crowded field, your score is certainly pretty good.<br/> <br/>Keep up the fine work. <br/> <br/>Alice</td>', 'GREETINGS FROM THE CRITIQUE CLUB  Wow!  this is spectacular.  You took a very difficult subject and photographed it well.  It is immensely difficult to photograph glass without showing everything that collects on a clear reflective surface and you nailed it.   I''m afraid HotPasta hit it with his comment that this subject has been done before on DPC.  Some of our "world-weary" voters find happiness in newer pastures.  It doesn''t - or shouldn''t - dilute the fun of those who want to master the procedure. You have an image that displays well and in this crowded field, your score is certainly pretty good. Keep up the fine work.  Alice', '2010-02-09 14:34:39.000000', NULL, 0),
