(5887905, 847919, 104091, '<td valign="top">The site seems to think I gave this image a 3.<br/>this is not the case! I remember this image well as the bird is the same as several images I  took at a local UK Bird of Prey Centre around the same time.<br/>I gave this image a 9 (That''s a Nine!)<br/>I''ve reported things like this happening to the SC before when I have noticed images that I  have given 3-4s the site says I have given 6-7. i have been told that as I had keyboard voting on and it is not possible for them to check voting issues after the fact, that it must have been a mistake on my part.<br/>This I have noticed has happened a lot lately. <br/>So please add a few to your final score. This is a slended image that I believe should have placed at least top 10!</td>', 'The site seems to think I gave this image a 3.this is not the case! I remember this image well as the bird is the same as several images I  took at a local UK Bird of Prey Centre around the same time.I gave this image a 9 (That''s a Nine!)I''ve reported things like this happening to the SC before when I have noticed images that I  have given 3-4s the site says I have given 6-7. i have been told that as I had keyboard voting on and it is not possible for them to check voting issues after the fact, that it must have been a mistake on my part.This I have noticed has happened a lot lately. So please add a few to your final score. This is a slended image that I believe should have placed at least top 10!', '2010-03-03 02:40:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(5889914, 849956, 101117, '<td valign="top">I chose this shot to comment on because I got married in Goa a couple of years back after spending 6 weeks working in Chennai :)<br/> <br/>The light in this shot reminded me of the place we stayed in Goa, it''s a great warm colour and this shot brings back memories of sitting having dinner by the water just after sunset.<br/> <br/>On the shot itself, I like the silhouette of the tree, and as mentioned the colour, but I agree with the others in that the centred composition lets it down a little.<br/> <br/>I can''t tell if those background trees are blurred in processing or or it''s a natural effect of fog / light, but either way, it suits the shot nicely.</td>', 'I chose this shot to comment on because I got married in Goa a couple of years back after spending 6 weeks working in Chennai :) The light in this shot reminded me of the place we stayed in Goa, it''s a great warm colour and this shot brings back memories of sitting having dinner by the water just after sunset. On the shot itself, I like the silhouette of the tree, and as mentioned the colour, but I agree with the others in that the centred composition lets it down a little. I can''t tell if those background trees are blurred in processing or or it''s a natural effect of fog / light, but either way, it suits the shot nicely.', '2010-03-04 07:34:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(5893518, 850639, 100393, '<td valign="top">I didn''t hand out a Mu award in January but if I had it would have gone to this image. Instead I''d like to retrospectively offer you the first WALL? award for this marvellous image:<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=859062" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/100000-104999/100393/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_859062.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/100000-104999/100393/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_859062.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/100000-104999/100393/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_859062.jpg"/></a> <br/></td>', 'I didn''t hand out a Mu award in January but if I had it would have gone to this image. Instead I''d like to retrospectively offer you the first WALL? award for this marvellous image:  ', '2010-03-07 15:40:41.000000', NULL, 0),
