(5913366, 851177, 1031, '<td valign="top">Very nice stop-motion shot (very sharp for that shutter speed!), and the relatively shallow DOF works well.<br/> <br/>Without the context of knowing something about the event, but just looking at the position and compositional relationship of the major elements of the photo, that (diving headfirst at a wooden rail) looks like a really dumb thing to do. ;-)</td>', 'Very nice stop-motion shot (very sharp for that shutter speed!), and the relatively shallow DOF works well. Without the context of knowing something about the event, but just looking at the position and compositional relationship of the major elements of the photo, that (diving headfirst at a wooden rail) looks like a really dumb thing to do. ;-)', '2010-03-22 14:05:07.000000', NULL, 0),
